int": "The Type Ibc fit is very poor with chi2 per point near seven and negligible weight under one percent and it puts peak nineteen days ago which cannot explain the flat bright plateau seen over the last "}], "weights": {"ia": 0.817, "ii": 0.0672, "null": 0.1157}, "wording": {"term": "likely", "text": "It is likely that the distant flash will still be brighter than the set brightness limit 4 days from now.", "words_match": true}}, "prev": "ab46a83718444baebd7b7bb787172e490e314929eef0d39a4b1abcd66e1c950a", "seq": 10, "time": "2025-06-19T17:41:42+00:00", "v": 2}
